## game-data-provider.test.ts
@flow-hash: 145e8cb5

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant TestFile
    participant GameDataProvider
    participant ClassKits
    participant RaceModifiers
    participant UnitCosts
    participant RaceAttributes
    participant SquadronAggregator
    participant GameModeProvider

    TestFile->>GameDataProvider: createGameDataProvider()
    GameDataProvider->>ClassKits: Load CLASS_KITS
    GameDataProvider->>RaceModifiers: Load RACE_MODIFIERS
    GameDataProvider->>RaceAttributes: Load RACE_ATTRIBUTES
    GameDataProvider->>UnitCosts: Load computeUnitCost

    TestFile->>GameDataProvider: unitTemplate('Human', 'Warrior')
    GameDataProvider->>ClassKits: Get Warrior kit
    GameDataProvider->>RaceModifiers: Get Human modifier
    GameDataProvider->>UnitCosts: Compute cost from stats

    TestFile->>SquadronAggregator: aggregateSquadron(members, provider)
    SquadronAggregator->>GameDataProvider: Fetch unit templates
    GameDataProvider->>ClassKits: Get base stats
    GameDataProvider->>RaceModifiers: Apply race deltas
    GameDataProvider->>UnitCosts: Recompute cost

    TestFile->>GameModeProvider: createGameModeProvider()
    GameModeProvider->>GameModeProvider: Load game mode configs
    GameModeProvider->>GameModeProvider: Validate mode integrity
```

Caption: The test file orchestrates interactions between game data providers, constants, and utility functions to validate unit templates and game modes.

## index.ts
@flow-hash: ae618763

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GameDataProvider
    participant GameModeProvider
    participant DSLFiles
    participant BalanceFiles

    User->>GameDataProvider: calls unitTemplate(raceKey, classKey)
    GameDataProvider->>BalanceFiles: loads CLASS_KITS, RECLASS_KITS, RACE_MODIFIERS
    GameDataProvider->>DSLFiles: loads MORTAL_RACES, CLASSES, etc.
    GameDataProvider->>BalanceFiles: computes derived unit stats
    GameDataProvider-->>User: returns UnitTemplate

    User->>GameModeProvider: calls modes()
    GameModeProvider->>BalanceFiles: loads GAME_MODE_LIST
    GameModeProvider-->>User: returns GameModeConfig[]

    User->>GameModeProvider: calls mode(id)
    GameModeProvider->>BalanceFiles: loads GAME_MODES
    GameModeProvider-->>User: returns GameModeConfig
```

Caption: The system orchestrates data from DSL and balance files to produce game units and modes, with clear separation of concerns between data loading, transformation, and API exposure.
